Revision history for Perl extension Alien::SDL3

0.01    2026-09-01
    - Install libsdl3, libsdl3_mixer, libsdl3_image, and libsdl3_ttf
      via xrepo using Alien::Xrepo::Base
    - Smoke test binds each shared library with Affix and checks the
      reported runtime version against ConfigData
    - A package that fails to build is recorded in ConfigData as an
      install error instead of aborting the build; package_infos, links,
      ffi_libs, etc. omit it and package_error/missing_packages (inherited
      from Alien::Xrepo::Base) report it
    - Use Alien::Xrepo::Base's builder directly (multi-package installs)